> Explain what on-device AI means in simple terms.

|-\| On-device AI means using artificial intelligence (AI) to work directly on your phone, computer, or other device, instead of sending data to a remote server.  

So, instead of your data being sent to a cloud server to be processed, the AI runs right on your device. This means your information stays on your device, and you get faster results without needing an internet connection.  

